<title>JAPAN: Sakurajima Futo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sakurajima Futo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.37		vs	    2.51</p>
<p> Operating	   60 million	 vs	   81 million</p>
<p> Current	     21 million	 vs	   42 million</p>
<p> Net		    6 million	 vs	   30 million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.42 yen	  vs	    1.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares		15 million	 vs	   15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sakurajima Futo Kaisha Ltd is a commercial wharf company involved in loading and storage of goods.</p>
</text>
